'' std/numeric's container shuffles and choices: ShuffleArray, ShuffleDeque, ShuffleList,
'' ChoiceArray, ChoiceDeque -- empty / one / many, a wrapped Deque, one seed giving one order
'' across all three and the plain-array Shuffle, uniformity over all 24 orders of four, a
'' counting UDT (ShuffleList copies nothing and keeps addresses), a nested Array, Choice's
'' write-through and its out-of-bounds error on empty. 'seed 42' is the committed order.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/shuffle.tiko -o tests/modules/stdshuffle.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdshuffle.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: seed 42: HBGDFECA
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: failures: none
